// Seek points of a long file. To show the world at a time t, a reader
// takes a keyframe (a snapshot of every entity) from before t and replays
// the changes after it up to t. The recorder starts a new file with a
// keyframe every keyframe interval (a minute), so that never replays
// more than that. An export or an import is one file of hours: its views
// are its keyframes every interval, and where in the file the changes
// after each start. A reader reads each view as if it were one of the
